# Ignore file used ONLY when building .clusterfuzzlite/Dockerfile. BuildKit looks for
# <Dockerfile name>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile and prefers it over the repo-root
# .dockerignore, which is tuned for the app image. Keep this list short: the fuzz build needs
# .clusterfuzzlite/build.sh and the server sources, and must never lose them to an ignore rule.
**/node_modules
server/data
